<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-2650] Column names from JDBC Interpretations don&apos;t respect capitalization. </title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-2650</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The names of columns in both tables and graphs do not respect the capitalization from the SQL query. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;For example: &quot;select YTD_Revenue&quot; would return a column named either &quot;Ytd_Revenue&quot; or &quot;ytd_revenue&quot; depending on if you&apos;re viewing the data in table or graph format. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;You can see example screenshots here: &lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/1/view/ywp0d5pxrgpe37o/Apps/Shutter/Selection_025.png&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/1/view/ywp0d5pxrgpe37o/Apps/Shutter/Selection_025.png&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/1/view/52n3tz16er44atz/Apps/Shutter/Selection_026.png&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/1/view/52n3tz16er44atz/Apps/Shutter/Selection_026.png&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment>&lt;p&gt;Running .8 on CentOS7&lt;/p&gt;</environment>
